                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cohomology+theory"} cohomology theory
                through these correspondences.
          %p
            This perspective has many precursors, listed in the
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "#PrevLit"} references below
            = succeed "\u201D" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/Synthetic+Quantum+Field+Theory"} Synthetic Quantum Field Theory
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/higher+differential+geometry"} higher differential geometry
            of
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cohesive+%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-toposes"} cohesive (∞,1)-toposes
          %p
            Before looking at the details, we indicate some of the characteristic aspects of
            = succeed ":" do
              %em motivic quantization
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %em>
                  %a{:href => "#TheMotivicAspect"} The motivic aspect
                ;
            %li
              %p
                %em
