            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KK-theory"} KK-category
            is regarded as the analog in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/noncommutative+topology"} noncommutative topology
            of a category of motives. This vague analogy becomes precise from the general point of view of
            = succeed ":" do
