          %p
            from an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28%E2%88%9E%2Cn%29-category+of+cobordisms"} (∞,n)-category of cobordisms
            with
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/branes"} branes
            and
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/domain+walls"} domain walls
            %em some
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/symmetric+monoidal+%28%E2%88%9E%2Cn%29-category"} symmetric monoidal (∞,n)-category
          %p
            The point of this
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/axiom"} axiom
            is that the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/higher+category+theory"} higher categorical
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28%E2%88%9E%2Cn%29-functor"} (∞,n)-functoriality
            of
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi Z
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Z
            is what encodes the
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/local+quantum+field+theory"} locality
            of the
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/field+theory"} field theory
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fundamental+physics"} fundamental physics
            of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/observable+universe"} observable universe
            called
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/causal+locality"} causal locality
            \: (spacelike-)separated regions of
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spacetime"} spacetime
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/worldvolume"} worldvolume
            behave like
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/independent+subsystems"} independent subsystems
          %table
            %thead
              %tr
                %th
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fundamental+physics"} fundamental physics
