                  –
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/path+integral+as+a+pull-push+transform"} pull-push transform
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
