            so as to turn one of the projections of such a correspondence around to produce a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+propagator"} quantum propagator
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
