            or equivalently the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/operator+K-theory"} operator K-theory
            of its
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/groupoid+convolution+algebra"} groupoid convolution algebra
          #TheSmoothKTheoryModelFunctor.num_prop
            %h6#proposition_8 Proposition
            %p
              There is a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/lax+monoidal+functor"} lax monoidal functor
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
