                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{O}_\lambda \hookrightarrow \mathfrak{g}^\ast
            the corresponding
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coadjoint+orbit"} coadjoint orbit
          %p
            Then the previous boundary condition for the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2d+Chern-Simons+theory"} 2d Chern-Simons theory
            of
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msup
                    %mi 𝔤
                    %mo *
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
                  %mi G
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathfrak{g}^\ast//G
            extends to a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/QFT+with+defects"} defect
            to the 2d CS theory of
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
